          ],
          "text": "High Overlord Saurfang commands Orgrim's Hammer during the Horde's assault on Icecrown Citadel, rallying the Horde and directing its Kor'kron against the approaching Alliance gunship. He says he has heard that his son is there as a powerful death knight serving the Lich King; if true, Saurfang believes he must end his own bloodline.",
